      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/texture.c",
      "evidence": "Common texture public0->1/1->0 transitions at25-66 also back cube AddRef/Release at507-518. Cube face query at747-775 shares the public parent count; internal draw texture and target holds preserve storage independently."
    },
    {
      "file": "d3d9-lock-tests.c",
      "blobSha1": "eb168cb32e6d15513e004f7e1e94f915f8bbd359",
      "sha256": "5bef4aa7bb287fa6045d8dbc3c1be2cb4c1180f8beed1c2ce12ca2da36fdd020",
      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/tests/device.c",
      "evidence": "Windows-tested public references at1697-1725: SetTexture and unbind do not increase texture COM refs; GetSurfaceLevel increments shared texture/surface count without another device pin."
